WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:03.280
Are we really going in here?!

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:07.080
Oh, what now?
You said you'd hang out with me all day.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:09.350
Yeah... but...

00:00:09.350 --> 00:00:12.400
Aha. I get it. Betcha this is your first time...

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.790
What?! Kasuga is...?

00:00:14.790 --> 00:00:16.840
D... Darling...

00:00:42.270 --> 00:00:48.960
As I tried to kiss you, as if to avoid me...

00:00:48.960 --> 00:00:56.770
...with your T-Shirt on,
you dove into the shining sea...

00:00:56.770 --> 00:01:03.140
The white flower petals on your soaking skirt...

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:09.710
Spread open upon the surface of the blue water.

00:01:09.710 --> 00:01:18.730
Tell me why, when you winked...

00:01:18.730 --> 00:01:26.670
...to tell me that you'd be mine...

00:01:26.670 --> 00:01:31.340
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
You're unpredictable...

00:01:31.340 --> 00:01:34.640
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:34.640 --> 00:01:38.550
Tell Me, Tell Me,
...my Angel of the Summer...

00:01:38.550 --> 00:01:41.150
'Tell me, lover, Tell me that you need me...

00:01:41.150 --> 00:01:45.690
Oh Baby, Tell Me, Tell Me -
I know that you're in love...

00:01:45.690 --> 00:01:49.090
'Tell me you love me,
Tell me that you need me...

00:01:49.090 --> 00:01:55.600
Tell Me, Tell Me - but you're a mystery.

00:02:06.700 --> 00:02:12.600
An Adult Relationship?!
Madoka Secretly Returns Home in the Morning.

00:02:13.870 --> 00:02:14.970
"You can't figure something out?"

00:02:14.970 --> 00:02:17.940
"This one here... "
"You can't figure something out?"

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:22.710
"That one, eh... "

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:28.640
"The 'A' in 'Ã2AB = AH' is..."

00:02:30.850 --> 00:02:33.010
"What's wrong?"

00:02:33.660 --> 00:02:36.090
"What's wrong?"

00:02:57.450 --> 00:02:59.230
It hasn't cooled down one bit...

00:02:59.230 --> 00:03:03.740
We're busting our butts to finish all the homework before the new term starts.

00:03:07.260 --> 00:03:09.220
Ayukawa...

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:13.100
...y'know, I tried doing
the problems myself, but...

00:03:15.360 --> 00:03:16.730
Welcome.

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.700
Oh... hello...
Welcome.

00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:23.520
Ayukawa wasn't there.

00:03:23.520 --> 00:03:27.270
And instead... instead...

00:03:37.250 --> 00:03:39.710
Sorry I made you wait, Shuu.

00:03:39.710 --> 00:03:42.640
Yo! Did you make sure to tell
your folks you're gonna be back late?

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:45.440
Gosh, didn't I tell you that
mom and the old man are in America?

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.580
Oh, that's right.

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:49.810
She quit?! Oops, sorry...

00:03:49.810 --> 00:03:52.220
She quit working here?

00:03:52.220 --> 00:03:55.190
I said, "maybe," didn't I?

00:03:55.190 --> 00:03:59.160
Oh... er, b... but, now... why did she...?

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:02.110
I wouldn't know.
Perhaps she fell in love with someone?

00:04:02.710 --> 00:04:05.080
What?! No way...

00:04:05.820 --> 00:04:08.780
No way could that sorta thing happen, eh?

00:04:14.320 --> 00:04:17.220
Guys can get overconfident about things so easily.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:24.230
Oh, n... nothing. I was just talking to myself.

00:04:33.740 --> 00:04:36.580
Say, by the way... are you her boyfriend?

00:04:37.010 --> 00:04:42.040
What?! Oh, nooo... that's ridiculous! Me and Ayukawa?! Ha, oh, no!

00:04:42.850 --> 00:04:45.630
Oh, you aren't?

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:50.370
In that case, maybe it could be true that she fell in love with someone, eh?

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:51.510
What?!

00:04:51.510 --> 00:04:53.400
May I have a glass of water?

00:04:53.400 --> 00:04:54.030
Sure!

00:04:54.030 --> 00:04:57.020
W...W...Wait a second, please!

00:04:57.020 --> 00:05:00.240
For a stranger, she sure is
rather straightforward about things.

00:05:00.240 --> 00:05:02.900
But, still... what happened to Ayukawa?

00:05:05.170 --> 00:05:06.180
"Tomorrow?"

00:05:06.180 --> 00:05:06.970
"Yeah."
"Tomorrow?"

00:05:06.970 --> 00:05:07.060
"Tomorrow?"

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:11.200
"I'll try the problems tonight... but I think there are some that I won't understand. "

00:05:12.450 --> 00:05:14.640
"In that case... I'll help,
in exchange for a chocolate pie!"

00:05:18.690 --> 00:05:20.920
"One condition... not the one from ABCB!"

00:05:41.710 --> 00:05:45.100
So he's the Kasuga that I heard about...

00:05:45.100 --> 00:05:48.480
What?! Madoka?! Er...

00:05:48.880 --> 00:05:52.030
You know something, don't you, Hikaru?
Tell me what's up!

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:57.540
I have no idea... I mean Madoka told me to keep it a secret...

00:05:57.540 --> 00:05:58.830
OOPS!

00:05:58.830 --> 00:06:00.320
What?! A secret?!
OOPS!

00:06:00.320 --> 00:06:00.410
OOPS!

00:06:00.410 --> 00:06:02.610
A secret?! Hikaru,
what's that supposed to mean?!

00:06:02.610 --> 00:06:06.690
Nothing! Nothing!
You'll find out about it soon!

00:06:07.670 --> 00:06:09.640
Oh! I'm sorry!

00:06:10.870 --> 00:06:13.480
H... Hey!

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:15.740
Wait, Hikaru!

00:06:21.750 --> 00:06:22.520
Darling!

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.170
Hikaru, we're doing it to help Madoka.

00:06:25.170 --> 00:06:28.160
Come on now, let's get going. Come on!

00:06:35.930 --> 00:06:39.630
Exactly what had happened to Ayukawa...?

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:43.570
I had absolutely no idea.

00:06:45.110 --> 00:06:47.890
So I'm telling ya, guess who!

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:50.540
I'm the person you want to see the most right this moment!

00:06:51.280 --> 00:06:54.400
Let me guess, you're taking
a bath right now, aren't you?

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:57.590
Say, say... c'mon!
Let's go out on a date tomorrow!

00:06:57.590 --> 00:06:59.840
You'll find out who I am when we meet!

00:06:59.840 --> 00:07:04.380
I might want to do
some good things to you too!

00:07:04.380 --> 00:07:07.000
You dumb-ass! What the hell are you thinking, man?!

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:08.330
You're gonna rip my ear off!

00:07:08.330 --> 00:07:08.660
Oh, well... Here, lemme...
You're gonna rip my ear off!

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:08.750
You're gonna rip my ear off!

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.950
H... H... Hey, knock it off! I was using the phone!

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:14.640
Oh, c'mon, lemme use it for a sec...

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:15.170
Whoa... Huh...?

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:17.040
That was close... Huh...?
Whoa... Huh...?

00:07:19.170 --> 00:07:20.040
Why you!
Wh... What's with this red foot?!

00:07:20.040 --> 00:07:20.180
Wh... What's with this red foot?!

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:22.140
Be stunned by my foot odor!

00:07:22.140 --> 00:07:22.230
Wh... What's with this red foot?!

00:07:22.230 --> 00:07:25.280
Hello? So, about tomorrow... Oh!

00:07:25.880 --> 00:07:28.410
Dammit! Just when it was getting good!

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:32.910
Hey, how many times do you have to get turned down before you give up?!

00:07:32.910 --> 00:07:34.070
What the... Dumb-ass!

00:07:34.070 --> 00:07:37.590
Didn't we agree to take care of the homework by tonight?

00:07:42.730 --> 00:07:44.820
Hello. This is the Ayukawa residence.

00:07:45.530 --> 00:07:50.210
Thank you for calling,
but we are out at the moment.

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:53.850
Kindly leave a message after the beep...

00:07:53.850 --> 00:07:57.970
Ayukawa... Where could she be, I wonder...?

00:07:58.410 --> 00:08:00.940
Does that mean... you're naked right now?

00:08:02.750 --> 00:08:04.720
Naked?!

00:08:07.090 --> 00:08:09.060
Hey, Hatta, who're you calling?!

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:12.240
Kasuga's!

00:08:12.240 --> 00:08:13.280
WHAT?!

00:08:13.600 --> 00:08:15.950
So, er... can you guess who I am?

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:19.450
Gee, who can it be? Kurumi can't guess!

00:08:19.450 --> 00:08:20.560
Hey, you!

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:21.240
Cut that out!

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:21.770
We ain't gonna get caught!

00:08:21.770 --> 00:08:22.990
Hatta!

00:08:22.990 --> 00:08:23.210
Let me talk on the phone! Here...

00:08:23.210 --> 00:08:25.170
Can you guess who I am?

00:08:26.110 --> 00:08:28.960
What was that? A crank call?

00:08:28.960 --> 00:08:31.930
Yup. Looks like it.

00:08:31.930 --> 00:08:34.210
My goodness! You'd better be careful!

00:08:34.580 --> 00:08:35.830
Okay!

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:38.970
It's awful. Too many crazy youths going wild in the summertime!

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.320
Say, who was that?

00:08:41.320 --> 00:08:41.760
Oniichan and his friends.
Say, who was that?

00:08:41.760 --> 00:08:43.720
Wh... What?!
Oniichan and his friends.

00:08:54.200 --> 00:08:55.740
And, so there you have it...

00:08:55.740 --> 00:08:58.860
In the end, we had to pull an all-nighter.

00:09:01.880 --> 00:09:03.850
It's morning already!

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:14.000
A... Ayukawa!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:15.370
Wanna a grab a bite before we go?

00:09:15.370 --> 00:09:19.190
No thanks. I'm gonna go straight home and crash. I'm exhausted, y'know!

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:22.060
You, babe, of all people?

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:23.590
"B... Babe?!"
You, babe, of all people?

00:09:25.030 --> 00:09:27.570
Shuu, you're so unrelenting...

00:09:27.570 --> 00:09:28.410
Am I?
Shuu, you're so unrelenting...

00:09:28.410 --> 00:09:28.970
Yup.
Am I?

00:09:28.970 --> 00:09:30.440
Yup.

00:09:40.350 --> 00:09:42.180
Notebook: "Kasuga Kyosuke"

00:09:57.570 --> 00:10:00.360
"Intimate Pub Papillon" "Hotel Candy"

00:10:03.240 --> 00:10:04.920
It felt like...

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:08.690
...my head got whacked
with a hammer or something.

00:10:08.690 --> 00:10:09.980
It was a shock...

00:10:09.980 --> 00:10:13.770
"Math Seminar -- Kasuga Kyosuke"

00:10:14.720 --> 00:10:16.930
Ayukawa...

00:10:16.930 --> 00:10:20.140
...what is... Ayukawa up to?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:22.240
Kasuga.

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:25.350
Huh? You're...

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:26.900
That's kinda rude, isn't it?

00:10:26.900 --> 00:10:28.990
Oh! You're ABCB's...
That's kinda rude, isn't it?

00:10:28.990 --> 00:10:29.080
That's kinda rude, isn't it?

00:10:29.080 --> 00:10:33.120
Yup. Call me Yukari.
Say, hang out with me, will ya?

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:34.070
What?!

00:10:34.070 --> 00:10:35.270
Let's go!

00:10:35.270 --> 00:10:36.970
Er... but...

00:10:36.970 --> 00:10:38.940
Why don't you just forget about her?

00:10:38.940 --> 00:10:40.200
What...?

00:11:07.710 --> 00:11:13.620
It was... a love story about
a man and an older woman.

00:11:14.320 --> 00:11:15.930
I...

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:19.550
I... Maybe it's because
I got no sleep last night.

00:11:23.130 --> 00:11:26.940
I... was falling... into an adult relationship...

00:11:26.940 --> 00:11:29.090
...an adult relationship.

00:11:42.350 --> 00:11:45.130
Maybe... Ayukawa was also... wishing for...

00:11:45.130 --> 00:11:51.310
...a relationship with someone a lot more grown-up than me.

00:11:57.690 --> 00:12:00.040
That's what was on my mind.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:01.960
Maybe I should go ahead... with Yukari to...

00:12:02.630 --> 00:12:05.600
What's wrong? Let's get going!

00:12:20.450 --> 00:12:22.290
Kasuga-sempai!

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:22.590
Wh...!

00:12:22.590 --> 00:12:23.250
Found ya!

00:12:23.250 --> 00:12:25.220
Oh! Oh!

00:12:31.600 --> 00:12:34.660
Damn...

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:43.140
Hikaru!

00:12:43.140 --> 00:12:45.630
You're awful! Awful!

00:12:45.810 --> 00:12:49.580
Darling, you idiot! Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!
Wha...?

00:12:49.850 --> 00:12:52.840
Hikaru! W...Would you wait a sec?! Listen...

00:12:52.840 --> 00:12:56.910
I can't believe you! I didn't know that you had an older sister, Darling!

00:12:56.910 --> 00:12:58.480
What?!

00:12:59.220 --> 00:13:02.190
Why didn't you tell me?

00:13:03.130 --> 00:13:06.460
Huh? What's wrong, Darling?

00:13:06.730 --> 00:13:09.150
Er... Well... Nothing!

00:13:09.150 --> 00:13:11.590
Really! Kyo, you bad boy!

00:13:11.590 --> 00:13:13.970
N... Now wait a minute!

00:13:15.040 --> 00:13:17.320
What a surprise that was!

00:13:17.320 --> 00:13:18.680
I really had no idea!

00:13:18.680 --> 00:13:19.640
Talk about a coincidence, eh?

00:13:19.640 --> 00:13:22.080
Surely! Anyway, Darling...

00:13:22.080 --> 00:13:24.410
...Madoka's gonna invite you...

00:13:24.780 --> 00:13:27.300
A...Ayukawa is?!

00:13:27.300 --> 00:13:28.990
That's right!

00:13:28.990 --> 00:13:29.580
Welcome!
That's right!

00:13:29.580 --> 00:13:29.670
That's right!

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:32.100
Okay, now! Let's get going!

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:35.120
Oh, please feel free to
come with us, "big sister."

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:38.620
I'm not going!

00:13:39.230 --> 00:13:41.550
D...Darling...

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:44.950
Who would... go to see Ayukawa?!

00:13:44.950 --> 00:13:47.220
Let's go!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:50.270
Hey, are you sure?!

00:13:51.710 --> 00:13:53.400
D...Darling!

00:13:56.710 --> 00:13:59.680
Darling... What happened to you...?

00:14:01.520 --> 00:14:07.840
Who'd want to hear...
Ayukawa's excuse now? No way!

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:12.280
Hey... Let me take you to some place really awesome. Come on.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:14.330
Yeah.

00:14:17.730 --> 00:14:19.250
He's not coming?!

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:22.760
That's right. Did you have an argument with him or something, Madoka?

00:14:22.760 --> 00:14:25.060
If that's the case,
then I could take care of him!

00:14:25.060 --> 00:14:27.340
You're too simple-minded! Dummy!

00:14:28.140 --> 00:14:33.310
Madoka, I've never seen Darling looking so upset.

00:14:34.650 --> 00:14:38.380
All right! Why don't we get started here, right, Madoka?

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:50.380
E... Er... Are we...
Are we really going in here?!

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:54.790
Oh, what now? You said you'd hang out with me all day.

00:14:54.790 --> 00:14:56.700
Yeah... but...

00:14:57.940 --> 00:15:02.400
I had no idea... that it'd really lead to an adult relationship...

00:15:03.280 --> 00:15:05.170
Aha. I get it.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.000
What? What do you mean?!

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:09.160
Betcha this is your first time... in a joint like this.

00:15:09.160 --> 00:15:11.690
What?! No...

00:15:15.830 --> 00:15:18.160
I'm really in the mood, don't you know...

00:15:18.760 --> 00:15:23.610
Well, I can... somehow imagine what to expect here...

00:15:23.610 --> 00:15:27.080
...but, ha! So did Ayukawa...

00:15:27.080 --> 00:15:28.600
...so did Ayukawa...!

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.020
A... Ayukawa!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:12.090
I... I bet that, at that moment...

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:15.170
...I looked like a complete doofus!

00:17:16.950 --> 00:17:18.830
All right, are you guys
ready for another song?

00:17:18.830 --> 00:17:20.850
Here's Swingtop's new song!

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:28.750
The lyrics were penned by our new face, whom I introduced to you earlier!

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:32.400
All right, go for it!

00:17:32.400 --> 00:17:34.560
Cutesy!
All right, go for it!

00:17:34.560 --> 00:17:34.650
All right, go for it!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.380
A...Ayukawa is in a band...?!

00:17:36.380 --> 00:17:40.010
Oh, gosh! Darling! You came, after all!

00:17:40.010 --> 00:17:41.120
H...Hikaru!

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:45.800
Hmm... Still, how did you know that Madoka was performing here?

00:17:46.180 --> 00:17:49.540
I get it! So, that morning...
she was rehearsing with the band.

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:52.980
All right! Now listen to
the song Madoka has written!

00:17:55.080 --> 00:17:57.450
On vocals is my girlfriend... Yukari!

00:17:57.950 --> 00:17:59.490
H... HUH...?!

00:17:59.490 --> 00:18:01.460
Yippee!
H... HUH...?!

00:18:28.580 --> 00:18:44.260
If a mere whisper is all it takes to turn your love around...

00:18:46.700 --> 00:19:03.870
...I'd throw pebbles of words
into your heart to hold you tight.

00:19:03.870 --> 00:19:12.940
My heart feels more pain the more I examine it...

00:19:12.940 --> 00:19:22.320
I smile softly to hide it... as I make a wish.

00:19:22.320 --> 00:19:24.080
"Broken Heart to Dream..."

00:19:24.080 --> 00:19:31.390
To love is more sincere than to be loved.

00:19:31.390 --> 00:19:33.060
"Broken Heart to Dream..."

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:38.130
My tears of passion I dedicate to you...

00:19:38.130 --> 00:19:42.920
"You Are Everything To Me."

00:20:06.050 --> 00:20:22.020
Each time I follow your eyes I find... there awaits someone else.

00:20:24.070 --> 00:20:41.370
A sad shadow reflects on the ripples of the lake inside your heart.

00:20:41.370 --> 00:20:50.310
If I could be where a tender voice is always there for me...

00:20:50.310 --> 00:20:59.650
...every time I seek it...
that's all I could wish for.

00:20:59.650 --> 00:21:01.380
"Broken Heart to Dream..."

00:21:01.380 --> 00:21:08.760
Like the Salvia Flower that
stands against the cold breeze...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.520
"Broken Heart to Dream..."

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:15.590
...I want to grow by your side.

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:19.500
"You Are Everything To Me..." "Broken Heart To Dream..."

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:26.880
To love is more sincere than to be loved.

00:21:26.880 --> 00:21:28.640
"Broken Heart to Dream..."

00:21:28.640 --> 00:21:33.650
My tears of passion I dedicate to you...

00:21:33.650 --> 00:21:37.750
"You Are Everything To Me."

00:21:37.750 --> 00:21:40.090
Be it an adult relationship...

00:21:40.090 --> 00:21:42.190
...or a teen-age relationship...

00:21:42.190 --> 00:21:45.360
...that's not the issue here.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:47.190
What matters instead is...

00:21:47.190 --> 00:21:51.740
...to treasure memories of all the
little things we experience together.

00:21:51.740 --> 00:21:54.220
That's what matters more...

00:22:10.240 --> 00:22:12.230
H... Hey, Yukari!

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:15.640
Yukari, would you knock it off?!

00:22:18.050 --> 00:22:20.070
Nice work, everyone!

00:22:23.090 --> 00:22:24.950
Don't!

00:22:24.950 --> 00:22:26.220
Why?!
Don't!

00:22:26.960 --> 00:22:30.450
It may not seem like it, but they
actually get along really well. So...

00:22:31.090 --> 00:22:33.560
But, the guy's after you too, Ayukawa...

00:22:33.560 --> 00:22:35.530
What?!
But, the guy's after you too, Ayukawa...

00:22:38.730 --> 00:22:41.330
Shuu and I are cousins, y'know.

00:22:42.310 --> 00:22:43.770
COUSINS...?!

00:22:44.910 --> 00:22:49.590
Look at that. You know,
Shuu's really into music, so...

00:22:49.590 --> 00:22:53.030
...I bet that Yukari's been a bit lonely lately.

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:55.480
So that's it!

00:22:56.920 --> 00:22:59.570
Sounds like you misjudged me... judging from your laughter!

00:22:59.570 --> 00:23:02.040
N... Not necessarily...

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:04.150
Shazam!

00:23:04.990 --> 00:23:08.360
Master, I used up
the remaining cream on this!

00:23:08.660 --> 00:23:12.290
I shall call it the "Hikaru Special!"

00:23:12.670 --> 00:23:14.620
Say good-bye to summer vacation!

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:15.950
Darling, Madoka...

00:23:15.950 --> 00:23:18.050
...in preparation for
the new school term, we'll...

00:23:18.050 --> 00:23:21.080
...KNOCK ourselves out!

00:23:36.190 --> 00:23:40.490
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer... "

00:23:40.490 --> 00:23:44.750
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall... "

00:23:44.750 --> 00:23:49.080
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter... "

00:23:49.080 --> 00:23:53.320
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.320 --> 00:24:01.200
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.200 --> 00:24:10.700
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.700 --> 00:24:18.510
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it...

00:24:18.510 --> 00:24:27.180
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.180 --> 00:24:36.900
You were waiting for
the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.900 --> 00:24:45.270
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.270 --> 00:24:49.610
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.610 --> 00:24:53.950
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall... "

00:24:53.950 --> 00:24:58.250
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter... "

00:24:58.250 --> 00:25:02.590
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.590 --> 00:25:07.410
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.960 --> 00:25:16.940
Ayukawa and I have been chosen to anchor a relay marathon.

00:25:16.940 --> 00:25:21.540
But, because Ayukawa told me that she won't run, I got ticked off and...

00:25:21.540 --> 00:25:25.380
...ended up vehemently pledging that I'd get the grand prize by myself.

00:25:25.380 --> 00:25:30.270
Next time: "Kyosuke and Madoka in a Big Fight -
A Three-Legged Race of Love."
